{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot for\u00a0the\u00a0stars,\u00a0let their\u00a0song\u00a0fill everyone's hearts,\u00a0and\u00a0bring\u00a0justice\u00a0long\u00a0overdue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take\u00a0the\u00a0role\u00a0of\u00a0Teacher on the\u00a0idols' journey\u00a0to\u00a0greatness. Guide\u00a0their\u00a0training with four\u00a0different puzzle mini\u00a0games, each testing\u00a0your\u00a0wit\u00a0and\u00a0creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do\u00a0your\u00a0best\u00a0and\u00a0you\u00a0can\u00a0make\u00a0it\u00a0all\u00a0the\u00a0way\u00a0to\u00a0Star-Filled\u00a0Sky\u00a0Festival. There, idols become stars and the\u00a0evil\u00a0Professor\u00a0Kerr\u00a0awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition\u00a0to\u00a0the\u00a0main\u00a0story, put the right idols together to experience\u00a0twelve unique storylines told between them.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3580300?t=1744391660","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580300/7711422bd8eac1b3d557fb36674a95ad76d6fbbc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744391660","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580300/b602f8e100cfe0bdb04694476830242b460d9c75/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744391660","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580300/b602f8e100cfe0bdb04694476830242b460d9c75/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744391660","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Hit Idol contains dialogues alluding to A. violence by parents against their children and B. killing of adults"},"demos":[{"appid":3614230,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot for\u00a0the\u00a0stars,\u00a0let their\u00a0song\u00a0fill everyone's hearts,\u00